---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---

<InfoLayout title="Contact Us | FreeOnlineToolkit" description="Get in touch with the FreeOnlineToolkit team. Send us your feedback, suggestions, or bug reports.">
  <h1 class="animate-in">Contact Us</h1>

  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">We appreciate your interest in FreeOnlineToolkit.org. Whether you have a question, suggestion, or found a bug — we're here to help.</p>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i> Email</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Send us an email at <strong>vxeexoffical@gmail.com</strong> and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-bug"></i> Report a Bug</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">If you've found an issue with one of our tools, please include the following in your message:</p>
  <ul>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">The name of the tool you were using</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2">A description of what went wrong</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-3">Your browser and operating system</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-4">Any error messages you saw</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-regular fa-lightbulb"></i> Suggest a Tool</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Have an idea for a new calculator or tool? We're always looking to expand our collection. Let us know what you'd like to see!</p>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> Response Time</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">We typically respond within 24-48 hours during business days.</p>
</InfoLayout>
